<title>UK: TABLE-Abbey National H1 profit rises 23 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Abbey National H1 profit rises 23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		32.1		   vs 27.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 10.2		   vs 8.7</p>
<p> Pre-tax		    687		    vs 558</p>
<p> Net interest income    947		    vs 814</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 673 and 700 million stg.</p>
<p>Current H1 pre-tax profit excluded a 67 million stg writedown of leases related to the proposed change to the rate of corporation tax announced in the UK budget.</p>
<p>Provisions for bad debts was 70 million stg in current H1 versus 49 million stg a year ago.</p>
<p>Full company name - Abbey National Plc. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
